# Generic clinic vertical (mandatory — zero fertility logic)

## Design principle

Booking clinic = **any outpatient clinic** (GP, lab, dental, polyclinic). Pollin `clinic-app/` is reference code to **clone and strip** — never ship fertility product logic.

## Never ship / reject in PR

`patientPlanId` · `PatientPlan` · `HormoneType` · `fertilityIQImageURL` · FertilityIQ · IVF/cryo modules · stim sheets · partner cycles · OB/OHSS ultrasound entities · `OrderViewStateService` milestone wizard · sex-split fertility profiles

## Clone scope (`vert-clinic-2.0`)

**Copy:** `order/` (crud, list, actions — not view-state wizard), `test-result/`, `shared/`, `specimen/`, `transport/`, `labs/`, trimmed entities with `businessId`.

**Skip folders:** `fertility-iq/`, `diagnostic-imaging/`, `genetic-tests/`, `sperm-cryo/`.

**Adapt:** `patientId`→`customerId`, `appointmentId`→`bookingId`, `Staff`→`Employee`, Firestore history→Postgres, PubSub→Booking `events/`.

## Lab state machines (`clinic-lab-state.util.ts`)

| Machine | Generic states |
|---------|----------------|
| Order | `NotCollected`→`Collecting`→`AwaitingResults`→`Completed`/`Cancelled` |
| Result | `NotReceived`→`Completed`→`Reviewed`→`Released` (+ `Rejected`) |
| Specimen | `NotCollected`→`Collected`→…→`ReceivedInLab`→`Completed` |

Port guards: `canTransition*`, `isResultEditable`, status history on every transition. Unit spec: `it.each` allowed + forbidden transitions.

